    "「%@」在你的黄体期出现得更多,这几天多留意自己。": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\"%@\" shows up more often in your luteal phase — be extra kind to yourself these days."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「%@」在你的黄体期出现得更多,这几天多留意自己。"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "«%@» aparece más en tu fase lútea: cuídate un poco más estos días."
          }
        }
      }
    },
