    "以上为一般性健康科普,不构成医学诊断或治疗建议。PCOS 的诊断与管理请咨询专业医生。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The above is general wellness information, not a medical diagnosis or treatment advice. For diagnosis and management of PCOS, please consult a qualified doctor."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "以上为一般性健康科普,不构成医学诊断或治疗建议。PCOS 的诊断与管理请咨询专业医生。"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lo anterior es información general de bienestar, no un diagnóstico médico ni consejo de tratamiento. Para el diagnóstico y manejo del SOP, consulta a un médico cualificado."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "以上为一般性健康科普,基于你记录的阶段为估算,不构成医学建议或诊断,也不可作为避孕或备孕的依据。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The above is general wellness information; phases are estimated from your records. It is not medical advice or diagnosis, and not a basis for contraception or conception."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "以上为一般性健康科普,基于你记录的阶段为估算,不构成医学建议或诊断,也不可作为避孕或备孕的依据。"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lo anterior es información general de bienestar; las fases se estiman a partir de tus registros. No es consejo médico ni diagnóstico, ni sirve como base para anticoncepción o búsqueda de embarazo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "以上为基于个人记录的统计学估算,仅供参考,不构成医学建议。": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "These are statistical estimates based on your own records. For reference only — not medical advice."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "以上为基于个人记录的统计学估算,仅供参考,不构成医学建议。"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Son estimaciones estadísticas basadas en tus propios registros. Solo orientativas: no son consejo médico."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "以上分析仅为基于个人记录的观察性统计,不构成因果关系、诊断依据或治疗建议。相关性不等于因果性,如有健康疑虑请咨询专业医疗人员。": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The above analysis is observational statistics based on personal records only. It does not constitute causal relationships, diagnostic evidence, or treatment advice. Correlation does not imply causation. Consult a healthcare professional for health concerns."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "以上分析仅为基于个人记录的观察性统计,不构成因果关系、诊断依据或治疗建议。相关性不等于因果性,如有健康疑虑请咨询专业医疗人员。"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El análisis anterior es estadística observacional basada únicamente en registros personales. No establece relaciones causales, pruebas diagnósticas ni consejo de tratamiento. Correlación no implica causalidad. Consulta a un profesional sanitario ante cualquier duda de salud."
          }
        }
      }
    },
