    "以上对比仅供参考,不构成医学建议。周期长度和身体指标的波动属于正常现象,如有疑虑请咨询医生。": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The above comparison is for reference only and does not constitute medical advice. Fluctuations in cycle length and body metrics are normal. Consult a doctor if you have concerns."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "以上对比仅供参考,不构成医学建议。周期长度和身体指标的波动属于正常现象,如有疑虑请咨询医生。"
          }
