    "以上阶段与日期为基于你的记录的统计预测,仅供参考;不构成医学建议,不可作为避孕或备孕依据。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Estimated from your own records — for reference only. Not medical advice, and not for contraception or conception."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "以上阶段与日期为基于你的记录的统计预测,仅供参考;不构成医学建议,不可作为避孕或备孕依据。"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Estimado a partir de tus propios registros, solo como orientación. No es consejo médico ni sirve para anticoncepción o búsqueda de embarazo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "以下分析基于你自己的记录,在设备端本地计算。所有结论均为观察性描述,不构成因果关系或医学建议。": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "All analyses are based on your own records, computed locally on your device. All conclusions are observational descriptions, not causal relationships or medical advice."
          }
        },
