    "在「日历」标记经期,在「今天」记录心情、症状、体重和用药,任何你想追踪的都能自己加。开始建立属于你的记录吧。": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mark periods on Calendar; log mood, symptoms, weight, and meds on Today — and add a tracker for anything else you want to follow. Start building your own record."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在「日历」标记经期,在「今天」记录心情、症状、体重和用药,任何你想追踪的都能自己加。开始建立属于你的记录吧。"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Marca los periodos en el Calendario; registra ánimo, síntomas, peso y medicación en Hoy, y añade un seguimiento para cualquier otra cosa que quieras vigilar. Empieza a construir tu propio historial."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在「日历」标记经期,在「今天」记录心情、症状、体重和用药。开始建立属于你的记录吧。": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mark periods on Calendar; log mood, symptoms, weight, and meds on Today. Start building your own record."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在「日历」标记经期,在「今天」记录心情、症状、体重和用药。开始建立属于你的记录吧。"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Marca los periodos en el Calendario; registra ánimo, síntomas, peso y medicación en Hoy. Empieza a construir tu propio historial."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在今天页记录心情、睡眠、症状或经期，Maren 会为你生成个性化的今日状态。": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Record mood, sleep, symptoms, or your period on Today, and Maren will generate a personalized status for today."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在今天页记录心情、睡眠、症状或经期，Maren 会为你生成个性化的今日状态。"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Registra ánimo, sueño, síntomas o tu periodo en Hoy y Maren generará un estado personalizado para hoy."
          }
        }
      }
    },
