    "查看今天所处周期、注意事项与下次经期;大尺寸可点开记录今天。": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "See today's cycle phase, what to watch for, and your next period. The large widget opens straight to logging."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "查看今天所处周期、注意事项与下次经期;大尺寸可点开记录今天。"
