    "需要至少 4 个完整周期(最近完成 + 3 个历史)才能进行对比分析。继续记录,这里会自动生成你的周期变化报告。": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Need at least 4 complete cycles (latest completed + 3 historical) to compare. Keep logging — your cycle change report will appear here."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "需要至少 4 个完整周期(最近完成 + 3 个历史)才能进行对比分析。继续记录,这里会自动生成你的周期变化报告。"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hacen falta al menos 4 ciclos completos (el último completado + 3 anteriores) para comparar. Sigue registrando y aquí aparecerá tu informe de cambios del ciclo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "需要至少 4 个完整周期(当前 + 3 个历史)才能进行对比分析。继续记录,这里会自动生成你的周期变化报告。": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "At least 4 complete cycles (current + 3 historical) needed for comparison. Keep recording — your cycle change report will appear here automatically."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "需要至少 4 个完整周期(当前 + 3 个历史)才能进行对比分析。继续记录,这里会自动生成你的周期变化报告。"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hacen falta al menos 4 ciclos completos (el actual + 3 anteriores) para comparar. Sigue registrando y tu informe de cambios del ciclo aparecerá aquí automáticamente."
          }
        }
      }
    },
